item.description:
&lt;div&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:18.0pt&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Senior SAP SD ECC Specialist&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div&gt; &lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div&gt;
&lt;div&gt;We are seeking an experienced &lt;strong&gt;Senior SAP SD ECC Specialist&lt;/strong&gt; with &lt;strong&gt;7–11 years of hands-on SAP Sales &amp;amp; Distribution experience&lt;/strong&gt; to design, configure, implement, and optimize SAP SD solutions.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div&gt; &lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div&gt;
&lt;div&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This position requires the ability to work closely with business stakeholders and cross-functional SAP teams to translate complex business requirements into reliable and scalable SAP SD ECC solutions.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;Key Responsibilities&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Lead end-to-end &lt;strong&gt;SAP SD ECC implementations, enhancements, and optimization initiatives&lt;/strong&gt;.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Design, configure, and implement SAP SD ECC functionality based on business requirements.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Analyze complex Sales &amp;amp; Distribution business scenarios and translate them into effective SAP solutions.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Collaborate with business stakeholders to gather, analyze, and document functional requirements.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Configure SAP SD processes to support business operations and organizational requirements.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Identify opportunities to improve and optimize existing sales and distribution workflows.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Support integration between &lt;strong&gt;SAP SD and other SAP modules&lt;/strong&gt;, as well as external applications.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Perform functional and system testing to validate configurations and enhancements.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Troubleshoot SAP SD issues and provide effective root-cause analysis and resolution.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Monitor SAP SD functionality and recommend corrective actions when necessary.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Participate in &lt;strong&gt;SAP ECC upgrade and migration projects&lt;/strong&gt;.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Develop and maintain functional, process, configuration, and testing documentation.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Provide expert guidance on SAP SD best practices.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Mentor and provide technical/functional guidance to junior team members.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Conduct training sessions and workshops for business users.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ensure SAP SD configurations comply with organizational policies and applicable standards.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;Required Qualifications&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;7–11 years of SAP SD functional experience&lt;/strong&gt;.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong hands-on experience with &lt;strong&gt;SAP ECC&lt;/strong&gt;.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proven expertise in &lt;strong&gt;SAP Sales &amp;amp; Distribution (SD) configuration and customization&lt;/strong&gt;.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience delivering end-to-end SAP SD implementations and enhancement projects.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong knowledge of sales and distribution business processes.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience gathering and translating business requirements into SAP functional solutions.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong experience with SAP SD integration across other SAP modules.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience integrating SAP SD with external applications or systems.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience with functional and system testing.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong troubleshooting and production issue-resolution capabilities.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience with SAP ECC upgrade and/or migration projects.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience preparing functional and configuration documentation.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;SAP SD Functional Expertise&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;The ideal candidate should have strong knowledge across key SD processes, including:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Sales Order Processing&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Sales Documents&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Customer-related processes&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Pricing&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Delivery and Shipping&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Billing&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Order-to-Cash processes&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;SAP SD configuration/customization&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Cross-module integration&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;External system integration&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Testing and troubleshooting&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Enhancements and process improvements&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Location: Mexico&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Work Model: TBC&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Hiring Model: FTE&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Client: Veolia&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;

&lt;div&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:18.0pt&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Java Microservices &amp;amp; GenAI Specialist – GCP&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div&gt; &lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We are seeking a &lt;strong&gt;Java Microservices &amp;amp; GenAI Specialist&lt;/strong&gt; with &lt;strong&gt;5–7 years of software development experience&lt;/strong&gt; to join the &lt;strong&gt;Store Applications Team&lt;/strong&gt; in a nearshore delivery model.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;The ideal candidate will have strong hands-on experience developing &lt;strong&gt;Java/Spring Boot microservices&lt;/strong&gt;, deploying cloud-native applications on &lt;strong&gt;Google Cloud Platform (GCP)&lt;/strong&gt;, building &lt;strong&gt;CI/CD pipelines&lt;/strong&gt;, and integrating &lt;strong&gt;Generative AI and Agentic AI capabilities&lt;/strong&gt; into enterprise applications.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;div&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;Key Responsibilities&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Design, develop, and maintain scalable &lt;strong&gt;Java/Spring Boot microservices&lt;/strong&gt;.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Translate business requirements into technical stories, designs, and implementation plans.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Integrate &lt;strong&gt;Generative AI and Agentic AI capabilities&lt;/strong&gt; into Java-based applications.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Apply hands-on experience with &lt;strong&gt;Claude&lt;/strong&gt; and other GenAI technologies where appropriate.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Use &lt;strong&gt;GitHub Copilot&lt;/strong&gt; to improve development productivity while maintaining coding standards and quality.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Design, build, and maintain &lt;strong&gt;CI/CD pipelines&lt;/strong&gt; supporting automated build, testing, and deployment processes.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Deploy and manage applications and microservices on &lt;strong&gt;Google Cloud Platform (GCP)&lt;/strong&gt;.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Utilize &lt;strong&gt;Google Cloud Deploy&lt;/strong&gt; to support reliable application deployment processes.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Develop cloud-native solutions optimized for scalability, reliability, and performance.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Independently troubleshoot technical issues and recommend appropriate solutions.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Collaborate with product owners, architects, engineering teams, and other stakeholders to align technical solutions with business requirements.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ensure timely delivery of features and fixes while maintaining strong code quality, testing, and technical documentation.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Participate in Agile software development activities and contribute throughout the SDLC.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;Required Technical Skills&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;Java &amp;amp; Microservices&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;5–7 years of relevant software engineering experience.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong hands-on experience with &lt;strong&gt;Java&lt;/strong&gt;.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong experience with &lt;strong&gt;Spring Boot&lt;/strong&gt;.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proven experience designing and developing &lt;strong&gt;microservices architectures&lt;/strong&gt;.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience building scalable, reliable, production-grade applications.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;GenAI / Agentic AI&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Hands-on experience integrating &lt;strong&gt;Generative AI&lt;/strong&gt; capabilities into applications.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Understanding of &lt;strong&gt;Agentic AI concepts and patterns&lt;/strong&gt;.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience integrating AI capabilities into &lt;strong&gt;Java-based applications&lt;/strong&gt;.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Hands-on exposure to &lt;strong&gt;Claude&lt;/strong&gt; or comparable GenAI/LLM technologies.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience using &lt;strong&gt;GitHub Copilot&lt;/strong&gt; for software development and code productivity.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;Google Cloud Platform&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong experience with &lt;strong&gt;GCP&lt;/strong&gt;.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience deploying Java microservices and cloud-native applications to GCP.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience with &lt;strong&gt;Google Cloud Deploy&lt;/strong&gt;.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Understanding of cloud-native architecture, scalability, reliability, and performance.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;DevOps &amp;amp; CI/CD&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Hands-on experience designing and building &lt;strong&gt;CI/CD pipelines&lt;/strong&gt;.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience automating build, test, and deployment processes.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong understanding of modern software deployment practices.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience supporting applications through the complete development and deployment lifecycle.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;Preferred Qualifications&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience with &lt;strong&gt;Java + GenAI integration patterns&lt;/strong&gt; and associated best practices.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience working within cloud-native application environments.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Familiarity with enterprise retail or &lt;strong&gt;store applications&lt;/strong&gt; is advantageous.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Understanding of Agile methodologies and modern SDLC practices.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience working with distributed or nearshore development teams.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;Soft Skills&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong written and verbal English communication skills.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ability to work independently as an individual contributor.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong analytical and problem-solving skills.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ability to communicate effectively with technical and non-technical stakeholders.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proactive approach to identifying technical challenges and proposing solutions.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong ownership and focus on delivering high-quality solutions.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Location: Mexico&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Work Model: TBC&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Hiring Model: FTE&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Client: The Home Depot&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
